Found under k24. The bundle declares the attributes (@run_ways in lib/Dist/Zilla/PluginBundle/Author/GETTY.pm ~line 1277, also in mvp_multivalue_args), but configure() only passes run_<phase> to the Run::* plugins (~line 1465, my $func = "run_".$_). So the POD example "run_if_release_test = ./Build install" (~line 156) has no effect. A probe with payload {run_if_release_test => [...], run_test => [...]} gave only Run::Test => {run => [...]}. Fix: pass every run way to its Run::<Phase> plugin (run_if_trial/run_no_trial/run_if_release/run_no_release are Dist::Zilla::Plugin::Run options, Run::Role::Runner), with a test per way.

